146" :question/problem "Let $a=2i-7j+4k$ and $b=5i+3j-6k.$ Find $a\\times b.$\n\n$a\\times b=$\n\n{{field-1}}$\\,i\\,+\\,$\n{{field-2}}$\\,j\\,+\\,$\n{{field-3}}$\\,k$" :question/worked-solution "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a\\times b & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & -7 & 4 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-7 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -6\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -6\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}2 & -7 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((-7)(-6)-(4)(3))i-((2)(-6)-(4)(5))j+((2)(3)-(-7)(5))k \\\\  & =(42-12)i-(-12-20)j+(6+35)k \\\\  & =30\\,i+32\\,j+41\\,k\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186295231 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a64fae9d-e2e5-5cc2-97a3-c76e01024a4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293588}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a64fae9d-e2e5-5cc2-97a3-c76e01024a4f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293588} :answer-field/id #uuid "6614727d-b3f9-5cfe-8f00-ff4fd92922c0" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294286} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "38e04374-186e-531f-9bbd-204857144c91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293168}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "38e04374-186e-531f-9bbd-204857144c91" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293168} :answer-field/id #uuid "7fb00d26-4755-51aa-a0f6-c647ce7f15c8" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294379} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3b24ae11-d3ff-5757-ae83-2080ccdf501b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186293174}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3b24ae11-d3ff-575